. We ended up staying at 711 Bourbon Heat for the entire game instead. They had 3 for 1 bottles of beer, which is a great deal, especially knowing that Bourbon Street is notorious for overpriced drinks. It was even better that they were put on someone else's tab ;) The bart..."},{"business_id":"Zh1JlS8z9pqJ39vs1hW7Ug","review_id":"64ezonJjYhb6mzKRLfjfSQ","date":"2012-05-10T05:29:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9197350144386292,"text_excerpt":"We came here at first to try to watch the Derby. The drink deals are awesome. the music was too loud but it is Bourbon Street. We went during crawfish season and all I can say is.. if you like crawfish, what they were grilling up looked great. Liquor on tap is also kinda strange but cool. The bartender was very nice and the people in there were cool"},{"business_id":"Zh1JlS8z9pqJ39vs1hW7Ug","review_id":"OZawhJHnRonJg4xmuTz1ew","date":"2011-06-05T01:04:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9196909666061401,"text_excerpt":"I actually really liked this bar - we came here several times when we were in town b/c of the consistent good service, friendly staff, 3 for 1 Happy hour deal, and relaxing courtyard. Things are a little more hopping upstairs, but I preferred the courtyard - you could still hear the music, but could also carry on a conversation. Additionally, the bathrooms were wayyyy cleaner here than in many of the other bars we stopped in."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Zh1JlS8z9pqJ39vs1hW7Ug","photo_id":"qAo_7zXGQAmIi9gHShWJ8Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qAo_7zXGQAmIi9gHShWJ8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.886988639831543},{"business_id":"Zh1JlS8z9pqJ39vs1hW7Ug","photo_id":"pXF52GZjx7yErR0xaIiPqg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pXF52GZjx7yErR0xaIiPqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8700666427612305},{"business_id":"Zh1JlS8z9pqJ39vs1hW7Ug","photo_id":"lPGYQNipOpyB-GbTL8UnUg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/lPGYQNipOpyB-GbTL8UnUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8660619258880615},{